SUMMARY:Mini Stuff To Do Fair
DESCRIPTION:A free community event connecting Lancaster to hobbies\, classes & local organizations. Come find something to do at the FREE Stuff To Do Fair! Browse tables of classes\, clubs\, hobbies\, and activities in the category of Arts & Crafts offered in and around Lancaster\, Pennsylvania.  \n\n\n\nSponsored by Visit Lancaster and the City of Lancaster\, this event is perfect for anyone looking to learn a new skill\, dust off an old skill\, make new friends\, or find community.
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/mini-stuff-to-do-fair/
LOCATION:Ewell Plaza\, 151 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
END:VEVENT
