SUMMARY:Pokémon Paint Party
DESCRIPTION:Unleash your inner artist and choose your starter! Join us for a fun\, beginner-friendly Pokémon Paint Night where you will create your very own masterpiece. Whether you are Pokémon’s biggest fan or just looking for a creative afternoon activity\, this guided class is all about getting creative and having fun! No prior painting experience is required\, and all painting supplies are included.\n\nThis event is perfect for all ages\, from young trainers-in-training to lifelong fans! *Anyone under the age of 14 should come with an adult. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/pokemon-paint-party/
LOCATION:Southern Market\, 100 South Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/SMC2606_01-Bookish-Beauty-Event-Web-2.avif
