SUMMARY:Stonewall/Pride Vigil
DESCRIPTION:Join Lancaster Pride in Penn Square for the Stonewall & Pride Month Vigil as they honor the anniversary of the Stonewall riots and reflect on the generations of LGBTQIA+ people whose courage\, advocacy\, and resilience helped create the freedoms and community we experience today. \n\n\n\nThis evening gathering offers an opportunity to pause\, connect\, and recognize that Pride is both celebration and remembrance – a reflection of where we’ve been\, where we are\, and the future we continue to build together. All are welcome.
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/stonewall-pride-vigil/
LOCATION:Penn Square\, 38 Penn Square\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
END:VEVENT
