SUMMARY:Trinity First Friday Speaker Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Trinity Lutheran Church\, 31 S. Duke Street for a Trinity First Friday Speaker Series event. The speaker will be Tim Slaugh\, Trinity Lutheran Church member\, presenting Trinity and the Revolutionary War. The evening will begin at 5 pm with the playing of the Church bells and a short organ demonstration. The main speaker presentation will start at 5:30 pm followed by sanctuary tours and refreshments. All activities will be held in the Church Sanctuary at the corner of Duke and Mifflin Streets. Free parking is provided. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/trinity-first-friday-speaker-series-3/
LOCATION:Holy Trinity Lutheran Church\, 167 E Main St\, Ephrata\, Pennsylvania\, 17522\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/First-Friday-July-26.avif
