SUMMARY:Covenant Chocolate Chip Cookie Concert
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an inviting evening of live music with pianist Benjamin Weley in a free community concert. Enjoy an uplifting program of expressive piano works in an intimate setting.  Admission is completely free and includes fresh homemade chocolate chip cookies and convenient parking. Artists on display are Sandy Leonard and Joanne McIlvaney.
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/covenant-chocolate-chip-cookie-concert-3/
LOCATION:Covenant United Methodist Church\, 110 North Mulberry Street\, Lancaster\, Oregon\, 71603\, United States
